Troubleshooting
Issue: "Permission denied" when running script

Solution: Ensure script is executable: chmod +x security_scanner.py
Issue: "No module named argparse"

Solution: Install with pip3 install argparse --user or use Python 3.6+
Issue: Scanner finds no issues

Solution: Verify test files were created correctly with cat test_config.txt
Issue: Unicode decode errors

Solution: The script handles this with errors='ignore' parameter
Issue: Script shows help instead of scanning

Solution: Ensure you're using -f or -d flag with a path
